              "content": {
                "html": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">BNMS members receive regular email updates covering:</span></p><ul><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Conferences and meetings.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Educational opportunities.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Grants and fellowships.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Awards and nominations.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Professional news.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Society announcements.</span></p></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">If you are not receiving the newsletter, please contact the BNMS office.</span></p>",
